# Day 11 robustness runs: per-run checkpoints and prediction arrays are regenerable
# (src.federated.robustness.run_all); summary tables, figures and per-run CSV/JSON stay tracked.
results/robustness/models/
results/robustness/metrics/federated/*.npz

# Day 12 diagnostics: per-run checkpoints and prediction arrays are regenerable
